cle/our-ecosystem-buzz-by-chaingpt-ambassador-program"><span class="truncate font-medium text-fg">Ambassador Program</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-fg-subtle transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-brand"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a></li></ul></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pb-8 sm:px-6"><h2 class="mb-6 text-center text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Quick answers</h2><div class="space-y-3"><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-bg-card px-5 py-4 transition-colors open:border-brand/30"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg marker:hidden">What is ChainGPT?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-fg-subtle transition-transform group-open:rotate-90 group-open:text-brand"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></summary><div class="mt-3 border-t border-border-subtle pt-3"><div class="prose-cg"><p>ChainGPT is a Web3-focused AI infrastructure provider. It offers a suite of AI-powered tools for crypto and blockchain users and developers — accessible through the AI Hub web app and via API/SDK for builders.</p></div></div></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-bg-card px-5 py-4 transition-colors open:border-brand/30"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg marker:hidden">What products does ChainGPT offer?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-fg-subtle transition-transform group-open:rotate-90 group-open:text-brand"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></summary><div class="mt-3 border-t border-border-subtle pt-3"><div class="prose-cg"><p>ChainGPT&#x27;s <strong>AI Hub</strong> bundles several tools: the <strong>Web3 AI Chatbot</strong>, <strong>AI NFT Generator</strong>, <strong>Smart Contract Generator &amp; Auditor</strong>, <strong>AI Crypto News</strong>, <strong>AI Trading Assistant</strong>, and <strong>AgenticOS</strong> for building AI agents. Alongside the Hub, ChainGPT runs the <strong>ChainGPT Pad</strong> launchpad and <strong>CryptoGuard</strong> for transaction risk protection.</p></div></div></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-bg-card px-5 py-4 transition-colors open:border-brand/30"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg marker:hidden">How do I get an API key?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-fg-subtle transition-transform group-open:rotate-90 group-open:text-brand"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></summary><div class="mt-3 border-t border-border-subtle pt-3"><div class="prose-cg"><p>Create and manage API keys from the API dashboard at <strong>app.chaingpt.org/apidashboard</strong>. Usage is metered in credits, so each request draws down your credit balance based on the tool you call.</p></div></div></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-bg-card px-5 py-4 transition-colors open:border-brand/30"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg marker:hidden">How does pricing and credits work?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-fg-subtle transition-transform group-open:rotate-90 group-open:text-brand"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></summary><div class="mt-3 border-t border-border-subtle pt-3"><div class="prose-cg"><p>ChainGPT meters usage in <strong>credits</strong> — each tool call consumes credits according to the tool and request type. You can use the service pay-as-you-go, and higher tiers (including benefits unlocked by staking $CGPT) come with larger allowances. See the pricing page in the AI Hub for current per-tool rates.</p></div></div></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-bg-card px-5 py-4 transition-colors open:border-brand/30"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg marker:hidden">What is ChainGPT Pad?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-fg-subtle transition-transform group-open:rotate-90 group-open:text-brand"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></summary><div class="mt-3 border-t border-border-subtle pt-3"><div class="prose-cg"><p><strong>ChainGPT Pad</strong> is ChainGPT&#x27;s launchpad for new crypto projects, used to run token sales (IDOs) and related launches. Access and allocation tiers are tied to staking $CGPT.</p></div></div></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-bg-card px-5 py-4 transition-colors open:border-brand/30"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justi